2026-10-08  Daniel Boyd  <danieljboyd@icloud.com>

	* Source/NSComboButton.m: As AppKit's: the arrow part is disabled
	without menu items, a split button's title part without an action;
	a unified button without an action shows its menu on the press;
	-menuForEvent: returns nil (no context menu).
	* Source/GSComboButtonPrivate.h: -_isMainPartEnabled,
	-_isMenuPartEnabled.
	* Tests/gui/NSComboButton/combo.m: Test them.
	* Examples/ComboDemo/main.m: Fill the menus up front.
	* README.md: Document them.

2026-10-08  Daniel Boyd  <danieljboyd@icloud.com>

	* Headers/AppKit/NSComboButton.h: New file: Apple's NSComboButton
	(macOS 13), declared unless GS_HAS_COMBO_BUTTON is defined.
	* Headers/GSComboButton.h: New file: GSComboButtonPart, the GSTheme
	methods that draw a combo button, GSComboButtonInstall().
	* Source/NSComboButton.m: New file: the class.  Split and unified
	styles, the menu shown below the button (above when there's no room)
	and tracked as a context menu, the menu's delegate updated once,
	NSCoding.
	* Source/GSComboButtonTheme.m: New file: GSTheme's default drawing.
	* Source/GSComboButtonInstall.m: New file: GSComboButtonInstall().
	* Source/GSComboButtonPrivate.h: New file.
	* GSComboButton.make, GNUmakefile: New files.
	* Tests/gui/NSComboButton/combo.m: New file.
	* Examples/ComboDemo: New example.
